    "new_line_limit": "Both first artifacts under12000bytes but165/183nonemptylines rejected. ft09 followup129lines/5686bytes is only9lines over120; no-line-limit extractor accepts it. Nonempty line count depends on layout; it is not a direct measure of dynamic cost or semantic complexity. This run does not isolate whether the120line limit causes inferior score.",
    "existing_default_restriction": "su15 followup105lines/4391bytes contains only one default: _comps(...,r0=10), a static integer literal. Whole-program defaults ban rejects it despite no computation at definition. Arbitrary computed defaults must not be inferred safe from this example.",
    "errors_masked_by_first_failure": "ft09 first artifact has missing final} syntaxEOF; su15 first artifact has top-level assignment. Both are masked by line-limit-first rejection. Concrete feedback reported the first actual host error faithfully, but did not expose all independently detectable static issues.",
